WEBVTT

00:04.850 --> 00:13.110
<b>A Playthrough of a Certain DUDE's
VRMMO LIFE</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:34.490
<b>Episode 12</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:34.490
<b>Earth Gets Angry</b>

01:45.080 --> 01:46.410
<b>You have logged in.</b>

01:49.130 --> 01:50.690
<i>No way!</i>

01:50.690 --> 01:53.950
<i>Has she been hugging me like this 
since the last time I logged out?</i>

01:55.390 --> 01:58.390
One, two, three.

01:59.580 --> 02:01.410
That's a mean way to wake me up.

02:01.410 --> 02:03.170
Fun time is over.

02:03.170 --> 02:04.230
We're leaving.

02:04.230 --> 02:06.770
Hey, why not stay here a little...

02:07.440 --> 02:10.570
This isn't what I like to do in bed!

02:20.190 --> 02:25.150
<i>I just can't get used to being treated this way, 
and I don't know if I like it...</i>

02:25.760 --> 02:29.770
<i>I want to start leveling up 
my kick and whip skills.</i>

02:29.770 --> 02:33.570
<i>And I'd better get another thorn whip 
to replace the one I just used.</i>

02:33.570 --> 02:34.630
<i>And...</i>

02:34.630 --> 02:35.460
Excuse me.

02:35.870 --> 02:36.880
Yes?

02:37.430 --> 02:39.700
My name is Emer.

02:39.700 --> 02:41.850
You are Earth, correct?

02:43.000 --> 02:44.390
You've got the wrong guy.

02:44.770 --> 02:48.340
Black hair. Black eyes. And a bow.

02:48.340 --> 02:51.320
I am quite certain you are him.

02:51.320 --> 02:53.240
I told you. You've got the wrong guy.

02:53.960 --> 02:59.030
<i>Somehow I can tell from the aura this guy's 
giving off that he's another wild dragon.</i>

02:59.030 --> 03:00.910
<i>I don't want to get involved.</i>

03:01.780 --> 03:06.580
There are plenty of people out there 
with black hair and black eyes.

03:06.580 --> 03:10.420
And more and more people 
are using bows lately.

03:10.810 --> 03:12.740
Anyway, I'll be going.

03:14.750 --> 03:17.920
<i>The reason I've got so many 
wild dragons showing up around me</i>

03:18.510 --> 03:22.370
<i>must be because of what 
I did with the baby red dragon.</i>

03:22.720 --> 03:25.380
<i>Part of this is my responsibility.</i>

03:25.380 --> 03:28.890
<i>But whatever responsibility I had, 
I've already fulfilled it!</i>

03:29.440 --> 03:34.650
<i>I don't want to spend any more time being 
forced to cook for the wild dragons.</i>

03:34.650 --> 03:39.430
<i>I'm an adventurer. 
I'm not logging in to play as a chef.</i>

03:44.540 --> 03:48.470
All that's left is to 
find an inn for tonight.

03:52.870 --> 03:56.390
So you are Earth, after all.

03:56.390 --> 04:00.720
It's really mean to tie someone up with 
a thorn whip and leave them there!

04:02.440 --> 04:04.330
You've got the wrong guy!

04:05.170 --> 04:07.960
Fly and Large Jump!

04:06.180 --> 04:07.970
<b>Fly</b>

04:06.180 --> 04:07.970
<b>Large Jump</b>

04:08.900 --> 04:10.150
You won't get away!

04:10.150 --> 04:10.940
Wait!

04:13.020 --> 04:14.650
An inn!

04:14.650 --> 04:17.480
If I can get inside, I can log out!

04:18.720 --> 04:20.640
Wind Booster!

04:19.270 --> 04:20.650
<b>Wind Booster</b>

04:20.640 --> 04:22.020
He's fast!

04:22.020 --> 04:23.770
If he gets inside that inn, he'll escape!

04:23.770 --> 04:24.580
Understood!

04:27.340 --> 04:28.730
How much is a room?

04:28.730 --> 04:30.410
F-Fifty gloh...

04:30.410 --> 04:31.290
I'll take it!

04:33.380 --> 04:34.700
Large Jump!

04:38.660 --> 04:39.660
Wait!

04:39.660 --> 04:41.000
Not a chance!

04:44.150 --> 04:48.230
I can't stay in the 
Fairy Kingdom anymore, can I?

04:53.930 --> 04:56.740
I'm sorry for all the fuss yesterday.

04:56.740 --> 05:00.460
Wh-What did you do?

05:00.460 --> 05:03.580
The queen put out a warrant 
for your arrest...

05:04.390 --> 05:06.050
A warrant?

05:06.490 --> 05:10.200
If you see this person inform the queen at once!

05:10.200 --> 05:12.330
<b>The Man Who Doesn't Want to Stand Out
What? Why isn't everybody talking about you guys, too?
But Stands Out More Than Anyone!
</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:15.790
<b>His Name is Earth</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:15.790
<b>An EVIL MAN who played with the Queen's heart!</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:15.790
<b>He tied me up!</b>

05:24.190 --> 05:25.120
What's going on?

05:25.820 --> 05:27.280
Earth!

05:27.280 --> 05:30.930
I didn't think you'd go so 
far as to put out a warrant.

05:31.360 --> 05:36.590
That's going too far. Even for you.

05:36.590 --> 05:38.390
Even I can get angry, you know!

05:39.250 --> 05:42.340
Wait! I can explain!

05:42.340 --> 05:43.680
The green dragon elder...

05:43.680 --> 05:45.720
I'm very disappointed, Queen.

05:45.720 --> 05:50.190
I thought you knew me a 
little better than that.

05:50.770 --> 05:53.950
There's only one thing I want from you now.

05:53.950 --> 05:56.290
Take this damn ring off!

05:56.290 --> 06:00.890
You put it on. You can take it off.

06:02.580 --> 06:05.290
And you, wild dragon...

06:05.290 --> 06:09.000
I'm never cooking for any of you again.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.430
So get the hell out of here!

06:11.190 --> 06:13.260
And if I refuse?

06:13.800 --> 06:18.610
If you're going to try and force 
me to, I'm prepared to fight.

06:18.610 --> 06:20.430
Have you lost your mind, child of man?

06:20.430 --> 06:21.980
Hell no.

06:21.980 --> 06:25.270
I can see exactly how arrogant 
your power has made you.

06:25.670 --> 06:30.760
I saved your country's princess, and instead 
of a reward, you keep making demands!

06:32.020 --> 06:35.250
If that isn't arrogance, what is?

06:35.250 --> 06:37.460
You dare call us arrogant?

06:37.460 --> 06:41.130
You need to learn your place, child of man.

06:41.480 --> 06:43.730
Let's take this outside.

06:43.730 --> 06:46.550
I'll rip you apart and force you to obey.

06:46.550 --> 06:49.860
And I'll blast a hole in 
that smug face of yours!

06:54.820 --> 06:56.260
<i>What I said then...</i>

06:56.610 --> 07:00.800
I prefer quiet. 
I don't want to attract attention.

07:02.200 --> 07:05.360
We shall grant your wish.

07:05.650 --> 07:09.120
<i>They promised! But...</i>

07:09.560 --> 07:14.490
<i>From a dragon's perspective, a human should 
be willing to do whatever they want.</i>

07:14.490 --> 07:18.570
<i>But they don't get to tell me what to do!</i>

07:18.800 --> 07:21.250
<i>I'm sick of them acting this way!</i>

07:21.540 --> 07:26.140
It would be dishonorable for a wild dragon 
to strike the first blow at full force.

07:26.140 --> 07:28.600
I'll let you attack first.

07:28.600 --> 07:31.090
All right, let's see what you've got!

07:31.510 --> 07:33.430
Arrow Twister!

07:37.400 --> 07:39.590
Is that all you've got?

07:39.590 --> 07:42.580
You have no chance, then!

07:43.390 --> 07:45.540
<i>I guess I should've expected 
a dragon to be tough.</i>

07:45.540 --> 07:49.070
<i>Most of my attacks won't even scratch it!</i>

07:49.070 --> 07:51.860
<i>But if I take even a single hit...</i>

07:52.150 --> 07:56.670
Now... dance the dance of death!

08:01.000 --> 08:03.460
I'll make your death painful.

08:03.800 --> 08:07.290
<i>Damn it. Should I use a suffocation herb?</i>

08:07.730 --> 08:12.590
<i>No... if the wind blows 
it back at me, I'm dead.</i>

08:12.590 --> 08:13.720
<i>Then...</i>

08:15.870 --> 08:18.810
<i>If I can't pierce his scales, 
I'll shatter them!</i>

08:19.140 --> 08:20.720
Twin-Fanged Arrow!

08:22.820 --> 08:25.100
Even a Heavy Blunt Arrow can't do it?

08:25.100 --> 08:28.030
A dragon's scales are unbreakable!

08:28.030 --> 08:28.840
Oh, no!

08:29.210 --> 08:30.520
Shield Parry!

08:33.460 --> 08:35.650
<i>That blunted the force of his attack.</i>

08:35.650 --> 08:39.180
<i>But that's the most I can 
do to resist him now!</i>

08:42.650 --> 08:45.080
So you managed to just barely survive that?

08:53.250 --> 08:57.290
Perhaps that shield sacrificed 
itself to protect its master,

08:57.290 --> 08:59.500
in one last show of loyalty.

08:59.900 --> 09:04.310
<i>I've been through so many battles 
with that shield, and now it's gone.</i>

09:04.720 --> 09:07.800
<i>He killed one of my partners!</i>

09:09.090 --> 09:11.040
<i>So I need to stand up!</i>

09:11.040 --> 09:13.410
<i>I need to stand up and fight!</i>

09:13.410 --> 09:15.070
<i>I haven't lost yet!</i>

09:15.570 --> 09:16.880
This isn't over!

09:20.150 --> 09:22.190
How can you still fight?

09:24.900 --> 09:26.570
<i>It doesn't matter if everyone laughs at me.</i>

09:26.570 --> 09:28.040
<i>If I look like a loser.</i>

09:28.370 --> 09:31.470
<i>I never wanted to be cool 
in the first place.</i>

09:31.740 --> 09:35.540
<i>In games and in reality, 
once you give up, it's over.</i>

09:35.540 --> 09:36.740
<i>So...</i>

09:36.740 --> 09:39.880
<i>I'll keep fighting until the 
very end, and never give up!</i>

09:39.880 --> 09:41.380
<i>That's what humans do!</i>

09:41.660 --> 09:43.220
I'm done playing around.

09:43.510 --> 09:47.340
It's time for me to give 
you the right to die!

09:49.460 --> 09:51.260
Wind Booster!

09:53.290 --> 09:54.950
This is what I've been waiting for!

09:55.310 --> 09:57.150
Hell Mine Oil!

10:08.590 --> 10:10.690
I managed to survive that...

10:14.710 --> 10:16.710
<i>My ears are ringing!</i>

10:16.710 --> 10:19.080
<i>But now's my chance!</i>

10:19.080 --> 10:20.840
<i>My bow skill...</i>

10:20.840 --> 10:23.300
<i>The one the Queen gave me...</i>

10:24.010 --> 10:26.020
I'll give you two powers.

10:26.320 --> 10:31.380
These two techniques are a recreation 
of powerful skills created

10:31.380 --> 10:34.410
in the time of the 21st fairy ruler.

10:35.190 --> 10:37.240
Seven Falling Stars!

10:38.240 --> 10:39.150
<b>Seven Falling Stars</b>

10:44.030 --> 10:48.180
This skill... It's the fairies'...

10:50.230 --> 10:52.300
Why do you...

11:07.850 --> 11:10.470
You're going to regret that.

11:13.010 --> 11:14.970
I should've known a dragon 
could survive that...

11:14.970 --> 11:16.720
This is the end!

11:16.720 --> 11:18.230
Wind Breath!

11:30.120 --> 11:32.580
So there's nothing left of you?

11:32.940 --> 11:37.280
That's what you get for not 
knowing your place, child of man.

11:38.890 --> 11:40.460
<i>Sorry.</i>

11:40.460 --> 11:42.770
<i>I used Wind Booster to escape.</i>

11:42.770 --> 11:44.800
<i>And I'm using Sneak, too,</i>

11:44.800 --> 11:47.110
<i>so you can't see me.</i>

11:47.720 --> 11:49.930
<i>I've got just one chance.</i>

11:49.930 --> 11:55.100
<i>And I'll lose this bow that's 
been with me for so long.</i>

11:56.980 --> 11:59.060
<i>The moment of fate has come.</i>

11:59.760 --> 12:02.730
<i>I offer up the life of my other self...</i>

12:02.730 --> 12:03.780
<i>discarding advantage...</i>

12:03.780 --> 12:05.580
<i>and my own life, as well...</i>

12:05.580 --> 12:08.660
<i>to force open the door to 
tomorrow before it closes...</i>

12:08.660 --> 12:11.390
<i>To ensure a tomorrow for 
those who come after...</i>

12:12.000 --> 12:14.580
<i>I put all of my will into this arrow...</i>

12:14.970 --> 12:19.930
<i>My life up to this point has had but 
one purpose: to fire this last arrow!</i>

12:22.570 --> 12:25.150
You're not dead?!

12:25.490 --> 12:29.050
<i>And the other gift the queen gave me...</i>

12:29.530 --> 12:34.370
It combines your life, your magic, 
and the feelings you placed into your bow,

12:34.370 --> 12:37.230
and fires a single, powerful arrow.

12:38.220 --> 12:41.070
Even a dragon's not invincible.

12:41.070 --> 12:43.280
And this shot will make you realize that!

12:43.490 --> 12:46.450
If you fire that arrow, you won't survive!

12:47.150 --> 12:48.610
That's the plan!

12:51.460 --> 12:54.510
Sacrifice Bow!

12:57.200 --> 12:58.740
Wind Barrier!

13:02.570 --> 13:04.820
I can't use any more arts...

13:04.820 --> 13:07.560
And I'm loaded down with status debuffs.

13:09.090 --> 13:11.520
This is the last shot, partner!

13:11.960 --> 13:15.910
Blast a hole in him!

13:32.790 --> 13:34.730
<i>Thanks for everything...</i>

13:34.730 --> 13:37.080
<i>For sticking with a guy like me...</i>

13:42.210 --> 13:44.450
<i>He's still not defeated?</i>

13:44.760 --> 13:47.290
<i>I'm out of ways to fight.</i>

13:47.290 --> 13:48.390
<i>Which means...</i>

13:51.750 --> 13:52.850
Don't do it...

13:52.850 --> 13:56.000
This is the end for you, wild dragon!

14:01.490 --> 14:03.130
What the hell?

14:03.130 --> 14:05.150
What's this dragon's level?

14:05.150 --> 14:11.790
Stats-wise, he's the weakest one. 
He's also old, and had little time left.

14:11.790 --> 14:14.090
So there's still a chance of winning?

14:16.850 --> 14:19.460
Should we nerf that oil?

14:19.700 --> 14:21.780
No, I'd rather not.

14:21.780 --> 14:28.150
If we nerf every clever idea they have, 
they'll stop wanting to make new things.

14:28.150 --> 14:29.680
That's a fair point.

14:29.680 --> 14:34.590
I'm surprised he was willing 
to sacrifice his bow, though.

14:34.900 --> 14:38.580
And he sacrificed himself at the end, too.

14:38.580 --> 14:39.520
That's the thing!

14:39.990 --> 14:45.290
<i>One More</i> may be a VR game, 
but it feels extremely real.

14:45.290 --> 14:49.430
But the fear and the pain 
didn't stop him at all.

14:49.810 --> 14:53.170
I didn't think he'd be 
able to beat a dragon...

14:59.660 --> 15:04.220
I didn't lose, but I guess I died, too...

15:04.910 --> 15:11.370
If I wait two minutes, I'll be teleported 
to the last place I logged out.

15:11.980 --> 15:14.400
Guess I'll wait.

15:19.870 --> 15:22.360
Get to work.

15:22.360 --> 15:22.990
Yes, sire.

15:22.990 --> 15:26.700
<i>Did they come to save the green dragon?</i>

15:34.210 --> 15:36.520
Wait, what are you doing?

15:37.120 --> 15:39.250
<b>You have been revived. Accept?</b>

15:46.360 --> 15:50.760
Why would you revive me 
before your dragon buddy?

15:50.760 --> 15:54.000
You have my deepest apologies for this.

15:54.920 --> 16:00.530
The wild dragon you defeated 
was the green dragon elder.

16:00.530 --> 16:05.720
I've learned he's become terribly arrogant 
and had been mistreating others.

16:06.970 --> 16:12.370
He threatened the Fairy Queen and told her 
that if she didn't put out a warrant for you,

16:12.370 --> 16:15.750
he'd attack the human and fairy towns.

16:17.290 --> 16:19.720
<i>She was being threatened?</i>

16:19.720 --> 16:23.680
<i>She only did it to protect 
the humans and fairies?</i>

16:24.160 --> 16:29.090
We came here to ensure 
he received punishment.

16:29.090 --> 16:33.250
But instead, we found that you, 
a human, had defeated him.

16:33.250 --> 16:35.080
I am extremely impressed!

16:35.460 --> 16:40.450
But that doesn't change the fact that 
I killed one of your fellow dragons.

16:40.450 --> 16:42.010
Are you okay with that?

16:42.010 --> 16:43.290
Of course.

16:43.290 --> 16:47.220
If you hadn't defeated him, I would have
 ripped him apart with my own jaws.

16:47.220 --> 16:50.430
He wasn't going to survive, either way.

16:51.540 --> 16:53.550
Oh, and here.

16:54.580 --> 16:58.530
We haven't compensated you for
 the cooking you did, I'm told.

17:00.740 --> 17:03.960
Dragonscale Light Armor Set

17:00.740 --> 17:03.960
800,000 Gloh

17:00.740 --> 17:03.960
Bow of ???

17:00.980 --> 17:03.480
The others are my way of apologizing.

17:03.960 --> 17:07.090
Dragonscale Light Armor?

17:07.090 --> 17:10.390
I don't have Light Armor skill.

17:10.390 --> 17:12.060
Don't worry.

17:12.060 --> 17:14.810
It's no heavier than a human robe.

17:15.250 --> 17:17.770
It's so much lighter than it looks!

17:17.770 --> 17:20.840
And it's easier to move in than leather.

17:20.840 --> 17:23.770
The service you've given us merits it.

17:23.770 --> 17:27.650
Any less of a reward would 
be an insult to our pride.

17:27.650 --> 17:30.150
And as for this bow...

17:29.610 --> 17:32.530
Bow of ???
Effect: Atk+???
Special Effect: ????  ????  ????

17:30.150 --> 17:32.530
I can't see its stats.

17:32.890 --> 17:38.590
It belonged to the one fairy 
who faced me in combat.

17:38.590 --> 17:42.540
It's a strange weapon that only recognizes 
those who meet its conditions.

17:42.780 --> 17:44.600
You may not be able to equip it now,

17:44.600 --> 17:47.230
but perhaps someday 
it will open its heart to you.

17:47.650 --> 17:49.040
A weapon with a mind of its own, huh?

17:49.390 --> 17:53.980
We need to earn your trust, after all.

17:53.980 --> 17:56.460
For the sake of my daughter, as well.

18:04.530 --> 18:07.770
My body feels so heavy...

18:07.770 --> 18:10.880
That's what I get for using Sacrifice Bow...

18:10.880 --> 18:13.160
I don't really want to do this, but...

18:13.400 --> 18:16.080
Pikasha, can you come here?

18:22.740 --> 18:24.020
I'm fine!

18:24.020 --> 18:26.080
I'm too tired to move, that's all.

18:28.220 --> 18:33.940
<i>I'm glad to have Pikasha around, 
but I feel like I'm abusing my privileges...</i>

18:33.940 --> 18:38.220
<i>I'm not supposed to like standing 
out or attracting attention...</i>

18:38.920 --> 18:43.080
<i>But it's true that I had fun that day.</i>

18:45.040 --> 18:48.220
Excuse me. I'd like a cape!

18:50.630 --> 18:53.360
Okay! Looking good!

18:52.820 --> 18:54.270
Fairy Cape
 Effect: Def+4
 Special Effects: Self-Repair  Reduce All Attack Damage (Weak)
Hood prevents others from recognizing you

19:04.620 --> 19:09.980
Her Highness fell into a state of shock 
after she saw how angry you became.

19:09.980 --> 19:12.870
She's like a living corpse.

19:13.400 --> 19:18.890
Right now, her mind's like a balloon 
that could burst at any moment.

19:19.550 --> 19:21.620
Please, be careful what you say to her.

19:23.610 --> 19:27.430
<i>Sure, I was pretty angry.</i>

19:27.430 --> 19:30.000
<i>But I didn't mean to do this to her.</i>

19:31.700 --> 19:32.640
Queen!

19:33.730 --> 19:35.280
Earth!

19:36.770 --> 19:39.560
I'm so sorry...

19:39.850 --> 19:43.140
No, the red dragon told me what happened.

19:43.560 --> 19:48.900
You only put that warrant 
out to protect your people.

19:49.920 --> 19:53.360
As queen, it was the
 right decision to make, I think.

19:54.090 --> 19:57.080
And I didn't even think about 
that when I snapped at you...

19:57.080 --> 19:59.430
I was acting like a child.

19:59.430 --> 20:05.300
No, I realize just how 
badly I've been behaving.

20:05.630 --> 20:10.820
As my way of apologizing, I'll do 
whatever I can to respect your wishes.

20:10.820 --> 20:12.140
Then...

20:13.140 --> 20:19.140
I'd like you... I'd like you to seal... 
I'd like you to seal this ring's powers.

20:20.280 --> 20:25.060
So you really do hate me...

20:25.060 --> 20:26.880
No, that's not it.

20:26.880 --> 20:31.470
I know I've taken advantage of all the 
special treatment you've given me, but...

20:31.930 --> 20:37.990
I actually don't like being treated 
that way, or standing out.

20:38.760 --> 20:40.620
You're right...

20:40.620 --> 20:43.230
You're telling me that, as queen,

20:43.230 --> 20:48.780
I shouldn't be going to visit you or 
giving you extra special treatment.

20:48.780 --> 20:50.430
That's what you want to say, right?

20:52.030 --> 20:55.410
I'd gotten too excited, hadn't I?

20:55.410 --> 20:59.740
I'm sorry for all the trouble I've caused.

20:59.740 --> 21:04.030
No, that wonderful parade you gave me,

21:04.030 --> 21:06.300
and those rides on Pikasha...

21:06.300 --> 21:08.260
That stuff made me really happy.

21:08.260 --> 21:12.090
You can only experience stuff 
like that in <i>One More</i>.

21:17.030 --> 21:19.560
And the only reason I was able 
to defeat the green dragon

21:19.560 --> 21:22.070
was because of the skills you gave me.

21:27.330 --> 21:28.940
It's done.

21:31.510 --> 21:33.220
Can we see each other again someday?

21:33.950 --> 21:35.140
Someday.

21:46.060 --> 21:49.900
<i>Now, it's time to say goodbye 
to the Fairy Kingdom.</i>

21:49.900 --> 21:52.020
<i>I guess I'll head back to First.</i>

